<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr PPI 9.8 pct in Oct vs 10.1 pct Sept.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr PPI 9.8 pct in Oct vs 10.1 pct Sept.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish producer prices rose 0.8 percent in October against a 1.1 percent rise in September, taking year-on-year producer price inflation down to 9.8 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said PPI rose 8.9 percent in the January-October period, compared with a 16.8 percent rise in the corresponding period last year.  </p>
<p> POLISH PRODUCER INFLATION	OCTOBER   SETEMBER    OCT 1995</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	   0.8	  1.1	  0.9</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		   9.8	 10.1	 20.8</p>
<p>  manufacturing m/m change	  0.7	  1.0	  0.9</p>
<p>  manufacturing yr/yr change	9.8	  9.8	 22.0</p>
<p>  mining m/m change		   1.4	  2.7	  2.1</p>
<p>  mining yr/yr change		 7.4	 10.6	 23.5</p>
<p>  utilities m/m change		0.6	  0.0	  0.8</p>
<p>  utilities yr/yr change	   11.6	 11.2	 17.8</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
